  "summary": "Selected evidence records: Amplifier is a command-line AI assistant with a modular, extensible architecture; the CLI is described as just one reference interface for the underlying modular platform. Chat mode persists context across messages and offers slash commands (/help, /tools, /agents, /status, /config) plus /think and /do to toggle plan mode; single-shot use is via 'amplifier run'.",
